This Vanilla Bean Paste so easy to make, you can use it in sweet and savoury recipes (obviously ice cream 😉).
I always add some to hot chocolate in the cool months or cool evenings outside on the deck. 
Don't worry too much about the type of vanilla beans to use, cheap ones will be absolutely fine. 

